WEBVTT

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.340
Why me...

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.030
Why is this happening to me?

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.060
The treat I'd saved for myself...

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.700
My dinnertime drink...

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.050
I'm leaving it all behind...{It's vanishing by the second.}

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.770
Over there, huh?

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:28.080
What else but the blade of love can free a maiden from her shackles of steel?

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.490
Wow! The blade of love!

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.850
A good woman's ideas simply exist on a different level!

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.530
Right, right?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.500
Hey, you two!

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.610
So you finally arrived, too?

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.350
This kidnapping was a magnificent idea!

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.010
We just finished the threat letter, too!

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.140
The threat letter?

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:54.100
"The lovely Anju is presently in our care.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:57.750
If you desire her safe return, 
come to the fortress in the eastern woods.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:01.020
The captured maiden maintains a brave front,

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.900
but the hope within her eyes grows faint..."

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.010
Indeed!

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:08.860
He's sure to come if he reads this!

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:12.030
Sister, I shall deliver the message.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.030
Okay, thanks!

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:17.000
Hey, get back here!

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:52.170
It's finally calmed down.

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.910
As long as Haku-sama's there, it'll be fine.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:58.930
Here's hopin' the princess's romance all works out.

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:02.090
<i>Not happening on my watch!</i>

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:03.980
<i>Not even the princess can have my brother!</i>

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:07.930
<i>That's it.</i>

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:10.660
<i>If I make it look like she really was kidnapped,</i>

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.790
<i>he won't treat it as just a prank.</i>

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.950
<i>He's sure to scold her.</i>

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.040
I just remembered I have something to attend to.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.260
Excuse me!

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:28.960
I keep telling you, this is stupid. 
Just stop already.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:30.920
Stupid? How dare you!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.260
I'm serious about this!

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:35.950
Absolutely! To a woman, {Ukon is}love <i>{Ukon}is</i> but life!

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:38.140
No risk is too great in this venture.{orig: It's worth risking everything for.}

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.890
Stop unnecessarily complicating things!

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:44.400
Don't you understand your role at all?

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:49.900
A single sneeze from you could spell the end of an entire clan of nobles!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.760
What nonsense are you spouting?

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:55.630
A sneeze from me could 
never cause that to happen!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:59.620
Anyway, we need to get you back before this gets any more out of hand!

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.900
You would interfere with a maiden's romance,

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:04.230
and worse, attempt to tear them apart?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:09.100
Such foul misdeeds shall not go unhindered while I, Nosuri, draw breath!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:16.800
A good woman does whatever it takes 
to make a maiden's love come true.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.140
There's trouble!

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.090
The princess has been kidnapped!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:29.160
She was at Hakuroukaku when brigands broke in and took her away.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.650
Are you referring to this?

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:37.610
"Anju is presently in our care. 
If you desire her safe return..."

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.660
A threat letter?

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.910
It just arrived.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.910
I-It just arrived?

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.320
Then what are you doing sitting here?

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.040
You need to hurry and rescue the princess!

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.080
There's no need to worry.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:50.790
Forget about it.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:55.360
I'd recognize the handwriting and flamboyant prose anywhere.

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:58.360
The princess probably put them up to it.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.660
Though I can't begin to fathom her motive.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.800
But even if that's true, Big Brother,

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.650
we don't know who could 
be lurking in the forest.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:12.720
Someone who knows her identity might try to hurt her!

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.050
And if that happens, it will be too late.

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:18.770
Her faith in Yamato and the Emperor is second to none.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.450
The princess is safe.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.530
If you won't act now, 
then when will you act!?

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.320
You have to put a squad 
together and go rescue her!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.960
Bring the capital's entire army!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:33.060
Nekone, do you want to make 
this bigger than it already is?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.540
O-Of course not!

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.960
I'm just worried about the princess...

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:38.800
There's no need to worry.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.730
It's true that she's a little odd,

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.220
but loyalty and duty are her life.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:47.030
It's impossible for the princess to be in danger.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.560
Still, Big Brother...

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:51.900
If I act, it will only worsen the situation.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.360
Another threat letter?

00:05:55.840 --> 00:06:00.260
"If you don't come soon, 
the princess's life is forfeit," it says.

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:00.860
Big Brother!

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:03.990
As I've said, my hands are tied.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:05.990
Another one!

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.360
They're very persistent.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:09.060
But again, my hands are tied.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.360
I said—

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:18.970
This truly bears the urgency of a hail of arrows.

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:21.880
Big Brother, why do you still hesitate?

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.300
<i>Curse you, Ougi.</i>

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:24.620
<i>Fine.</i>

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:27.550
<i>There's no telling what you'll 
do if I keep refusing.</i>

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.640
Are you leaving?

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.230
Someone, fetch my armor!

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.150
Isn't he here yet?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.770
What is he doing!?

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:42.280
Wait...

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:46.530
What if he just doesn't care about me?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.540
Calm down!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.470
Love isn't something you can rush.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.570
But...

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.540
<i>I need to take her back before it's too late!</i>

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:57.490
<i>Got it!</i>

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.550
Did I fail to tie you up tightly enough?

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.820
Sister, I've returned.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:10.830
Ougi! You're back!

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.100
So, what news of Anju's love?

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:15.570
It took some effort,

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:17.860
but as per your wishes, he is on his way here.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:21.710
So my beloved Oshutoru is coming, then!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.780
So, your beloved's name is Oshutoru?

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.660
Come then, Oshutoru!

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:31.260
Save your beloved from my hands!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.240
Oshutoru, my favored servant!

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:35.830
Now is the time to show me your skill!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.720
Oshutoru, her favored servant!

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.340
Your foe shall be none other than me!

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:41.760
Oshutoru, General of the Right!

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:44.090
Come and save me!

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.840
Oshutoru, General of the Right!

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:49.950
Come forth and taste my blade!

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:52.930
Favored servant?

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.100
General of the Right?

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:58.070
Oshutoru, General of the Right?

00:07:58.730 --> 00:07:59.780
Oshutoru?

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.840
Oshutoru!?

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:05.610
Which means... Anju...

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:13.110
Are you actually... the p-p-princess of Yamato?

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:13.940
Indeed!

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:18.120
I am the heir to the Emperor, Princess Anju!

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.630
Did I not mention that?

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:24.170
No, you did <i>not</i>!

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:32.100
This is so good!

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:35.400
Ain't nothin' beats this on a chilly night.

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.530
Oshutoru-sama?

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.290
Where's he off in a rush to 
at this time of the night?

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.420
Nekone?

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:08.550
My princess!

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.800
I beg mercy for my impertinence!

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.000
Don't worry about it!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.020
You and I are friends!

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:19.060
Your words honor me!

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:22.440
Anyway, when Oshutoru gets here,
I'll be counting on you!

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:24.940
Huh? Counting on me to do what?

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:28.700
Of course, to pretend to be 
a bandit and fight him!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:32.110
Um... You want me to fight 
the defenders of the capital,

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:33.830
and the Emperor's best troops?

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.020
That's right!

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:38.080
Oshutoru will risk his life to save me!

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:42.100
Um, but...  Please, listen to me!

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:43.080
<i>That's why I told you to stop!</i>

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.270
How far you think they're goin'?

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.230
No idea.

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:10.240
Even back here, it makes such 
a nice slurping sound...

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:12.870
He's here!?

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.980
Wh-What do I do?

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:20.260
Well, Sister, it appears he has arrived.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.410
Let us be away.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.160
Her beloved is here.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.280
Perhaps we should leave,
 so they can be alone.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.790
I've secured an escape route.

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:31.690
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.800
We need to give them some privacy.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:38.600
S-So, Princess, I'll be going—

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.060
What are you talking about?

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:43.580
You haven't fought Oshutoru yet.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:46.430
B-But, Princess...

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:47.520
Sister.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.830
Right... Please forgive me.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.700
W-Wait!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.390
Please!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.450
You're all I have!

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:01.700
You're the only one I can rely on!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.920
B-But...

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:04.920
Sister.

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:18.610
You've finally come to your senses?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.250
Let's get out of here!

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.610
What are you talking about?

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.100
Huh?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:26.500
You're going to be a bandit 
and fight Oshutoru, too!

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.110
What!?

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:28.520
Nosuri!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.110
A good woman...

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:33.800
keeps her promises!

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.600
Splendid, Sister!

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.690
<i>I don't get this guy at all.</i>

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.630
There is no greater honor than this!

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:59.140
<i>How did I get myself into this mess?</i>

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.340
Oshutoru-sama!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:05.560
<i>Haku!</i>

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.280
Haku?

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:14.490
He's still at it?

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.150
A-Anju-sama...

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.660
Greetings, Oshutoru!

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:27.540
I'd thought you succumbed to cowardice and fled!

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:31.540
If you truly love the princess,

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:35.800
place your life at stake to steal her from me in battle!

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:39.800
Oshutoru!

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:40.530
Stay back!

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.670
Come no closer!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:44.030
I care not for mine own{QQ: this is archaic, don't bother me about it} death!

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.110
Flee while you still can!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.730
Silence! Not a word!

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:49.940
Oshutoru!

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:54.910
This is all an act, right?

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:57.000
They can't do that to Anju-sama!

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.710
This's set my pulse all racin'!

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:03.500
Seconds please!

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:03.830
Right.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:05.700
The princess...

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:08.030
Well? Where is your response?

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.440
Have you no concern for the fate of your princess?

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:13.840
Or perhaps you hold your own life more dearly than hers?

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:17.680
Is <i>that</i> the full extent of your love!?

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:19.490
Show me how you feel about her!

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:20.670
Stay back!

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:22.970
Flee while you still can!

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.970
Now, draw your blade of love,

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:28.580
which will free the maiden 
from these shackles of steel!

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:32.610
You will face my comrade first.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:38.280
He is a cruel, heartless man who 
desires the princess's life!

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.520
Go forth!

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:39.990
Hey...

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.340
Are you certain about this?

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.140
A terrible fate will befall the princess!

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:47.260
Oshutoru, run!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:47.990
Hey!

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:49.990
Go!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.620
Go? Seriously?

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.180
However, if you give even a moment's hesitation

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:57.050
and abandon the one you love to her death,

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:59.600
I shall cleave her in two!

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.380
Prepare yourself!

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:12.220
What are you doing?

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.380
Go, my comrade!

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:20.130
Enemy reinforcements! Five thousand of them!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:20.650
Huh?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.850
Um... Oh!

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:25.720
You deceived me, Oshutoru!

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:29.540
Coward! Not only have you brought your men,

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:31.660
you've also called for reinforcements!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.910
It appears I have no choice but to kill the princess,

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.470
then take my own life!

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:39.250
Tell my companions, my friends,

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:42.640
that I died a glorious death!

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.170
Don't be rash!

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:47.570
We have the princess!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.470
We should run away for now!

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:51.670
Unhand me! Unhand me!

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:55.910
I will not bear the shame of 
being captured by the enemy!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.760
Please don't be rash!

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:01.440
Oh, no!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:05.590
Oh, no!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:12.420
Oh, no!

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:18.710
Oh, no!

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:21.210
Oh, no!

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:23.970
<i>I guess it's time.</i>

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:27.970
Big Brother!

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.230
Oshutoru!

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:37.730
H-He's coming.

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:39.480
He's really coming.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:41.730
What do we do?

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:59.120
Please forgive me!

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:02.810
Oshutoru!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:05.280
Your beloved Anju is here!

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.380
Oshutoru!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.510
Stop it, you idiot!

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:09.260
Oshutoru!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:10.760
I said stop!

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:19.220
What's wrong?

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.610
Show me the true extent of your abilities!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:26.260
Wait...

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:28.860
It's me! It's me!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:38.450
Draw your weapon.

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:40.860
Or is it just for show?

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.550
Calm down, Oshutoru!

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:54.220
You know this was all an act!

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:01.780
Excellent!

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:02.980
Go, Oshutoru!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:05.520
W-Wait... Haku!

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:11.120
Two men c-colliding so violently...

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.120
F-From the side! F-From behind!

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:14.120
This one's rotten.{She sure is}

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.220
You've gotten better, huh?

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:42.860
Is it over?

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:43.610
Haku!

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:45.610
What are you doing?

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:47.360
Stand up! Stand up!

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:50.140
It was only just getting interesting!

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:52.240
Stand up and fight!

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.810
W-Well, never mind.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.630
What's important is that you came.

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:09.850
Oshutoru, thank you for coming to save me.

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:12.130
You are the servant I am most proud of!

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.440
I commend you!

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.770
Why aren't you saying anything?

00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:20.620
I'm praising you!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:27.110
My own failures have clouded your judgment,

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:29.360
and are directly responsible for this outcome.

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:32.530
I apologize from the bottom of my heart.

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:36.550
O-Oh, it's not that big a deal!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.310
I'm safe, as you can see—

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.420
This incident was entirely my fault.

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:45.230
For the crime of allowing 
you to be kidnapped,

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:46.800
I should be put to death.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.550
Wh-What are you saying?

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.280
Now that this has happened,

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:55.800
I have no choice but to abdicate and take my own life.

00:18:57.430 --> 00:18:59.970
W-Wait! You mustn't!

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:00.310
No.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:05.180
The weight of this crime is such that it cannot be forgiven.

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:08.690
Hey, this is an act, right?

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:19.570
<i>A single sneeze from you could spell the end of an entire clan of nobles!</i>

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.260
I understand now.

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:34.770
It was my fault.

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:38.350
I'll never do anything like this again,

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:40.850
so don't say that!

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:47.550
If this nation's defender 
was lost because of me...

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:51.830
How could I face my father, or the people?

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:55.360
I beg you!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.750
Please, continue to serve me and help me!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.500
Anju-sama is bowing?

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:05.250
Princess...

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:10.500
<i>Looks like she finally understands 
the severity of her actions.</i>

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:14.950
<i>Still, she's humble{orig: unselfish} enough to bow 
her head to one of her own men.</i>

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.260
<i>I'm a little impressed, Princess.</i>

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.410
Princess, please raise your head.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:31.050
I am honored that you would give me 
a chance to atone for my incompetence.

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:36.840
I shall continue to serve the people of Yamato with undying loyalty.

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:43.200
Hail to the princess!

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.410
Hail to Oshutoru!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:48.410
Hail to the princess!

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:57.740
Oshutoru, I couldn't be happier 
that you changed your mind.

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:01.570
From now on, I'm going to keep my 
own position in mind and be a good—

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:05.930
Mu...ne...chika?

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:10.190
It appears your little pranks 
got a bit out of hand.

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:14.610
I did not wish for them to 
become unduly concerned,

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:17.410
so I contacted her guardian.

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:23.760
No!

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:36.110
Now then, whatever the reason,

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:40.120
to kidnap the princess is a serious crime.

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:43.850
To ensure they never attempt an 
endeavor as foolhardy as this again,

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:48.730
Haku, I appoint you to keep an eye on them.

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:27.690
Haku-san...
